poisoned-ambient-read: this path is a DIRECTORY on purpose. The config loader keeps a
candidate that exists and is not a symlink, and reading a directory is an
error, so an ambient HOME / XDG_CONFIG_HOME / OCX_HOME read fails the case
(ocx_cli_seam_test, ADR C-SEAM invariant 1). A regular file would reach
the sandbox as a symlink, which the loader skips.
